+# GLM-5.2 模型 Forward 峰值显存统计点位分析报告
+
+> 基于 vllm-ascend v0.30.0，分析 GLM-5.2（`glm_moe_dsa`）在关闭 MTP 投机解码后的
+> forward 执行路径，给出峰值显存统计的插桩文件范围和说明。
+
+---
+
+## 一、服务配置
+
+```bash
+export HCCL_BUFFSIZE=768
+export HCCL_OP_EXPANSION_MODE="AIV"
+export PYTORCH_NPU_ALLOC_CONF=expandable_segments:True
+
+vllm serve <MODEL_PATH> \
+  --seed 1024 \
+  --host 0.0.0.0 --port 8000 \
+  --served-model-name glm-52 \
+  --max-model-len 1024000 \
+  --max-num-batched-tokens 16384 \
+  --gpu-memory-utilization 0.80 \
+  --max-num-seqs 32 \
+  --tensor-parallel-size 16 \
+  --decode-context-parallel-size 16 \
+  --cp-kv-cache-interleave-size 128 \
+  --compilation-config '{"cudagraph_mode": "FULL_DECODE_ONLY", "cudagraph_capture_sizes": [4, 16, 128]}' \
+  --kv-cache-dtype int8 \
+  --attention_config.indexer_kv_dtype int8 \
+  --additional-config '{"enable_flashcomm1": true, "enable_dsa_cp": true, "ascend_compilation_config": {"enable_npugraph_ex": true, "enable_static_kernel": false}, "fuse_muls_add": true, "multistream_overlap_shared_expert": true, "enable_mc2_hierarchy_comm": false, "enable_cpu_binding": true, "weight_nz_mode": 1}' \
+  --quantization ascend \
+  --enable-expert-parallel \
+  --safetensors-load-strategy prefetch
+# 注意：已移除 --speculative-config（关闭 MTP 投机解码）
+```
+
+### 配置触发的执行分支
+
+| 配置项 | 值 | 触发的分支 | 代码位置 |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| `enable_dsa_cp` | true | **强制 v1 runner**（v2 不兼容 DSA-CP） | `ascend_config.py:703-707` |
+| `enable_dsa_cp` | true | **自动启用 FlashComm1** → 启用 SP-MoE | `ascend_config.py:752-756` |
+| v1 + SP-MoE + DSA-CP | — | `model_cls = AscendDSACPModel` | `deepseek_mtp.py:232-237` |
+| `decode_context_parallel_size` | 16 | DCP=16，KV cache 在 16 rank 间分片 | — |
+| `kv-cache-dtype` | int8 | KV cache INT8 存储 | `patch_kv_cache_dtype.py:94` |
+| `indexer_kv_dtype` | int8 | Indexer K cache INT8 | `patch_indexer_kv_dtype.py:89` |
+| `cudagraph_mode` | FULL_DECODE_ONLY | decode 用 FULL 图，prefill eager | — |
+| `quantization` | ascend | W4A8 量化（AscendModelSlimConfig） | — |
+| `weight_nz_mode` | 1 | 权重 NZ 格式 | — |
+| `multistream_overlap_shared_expert` | true | 共享专家独立流重叠 | — |
+| 无 `--speculative-config` | — | 无 MTP draft，无 verify batch | — |
+
+### 算子选择
+
+KV cache dtype=int8 → `get_dsa_attn_kv_plan()`（`dsa_attn_kv_plan.py:215-273`）：
+
+```
+① TurboQuant INT4? → No
+② 旧硬件 fallback? → No (A3 支持 DSv4)
+③ BF16 KV? → No (是 int8)
+④ 默认 → mixed_quant_sparse_flash_mla_fp8  ★ 使用的 sparse attention 算子
+   + uses_kv_compress_epilog=True (用 cann_ops_transformer.kv_compress_epilog 写 INT8 KV)
+```
+
+---
+
+## 二、Forward 执行路径（关闭 MTP）
+
+```
+NPUModelRunner.forward()                                    ← worker/model_runner_v1.py
+  → AscendGlmMoeDsaForCausalLM.forward()                    ← models/deepseek_mtp.py:230
+    → super().forward() → 上游 GlmMoeDsaForCausalLM
+      → self.model = AscendDSACPModel (因 v1+SP+DSA-CP)     ← models/deepseek_mtp.py:138
+        → _patched_forward()                                 ← patch/worker/patch_deepseek_v2.py:384
+          → embed_input_ids(input_ids)                       ← 上游 VocabParallelEmbedding
+          → for idx, layer in layers:                        ← L426-432, 78 层循环
+              → AscendDSACPDecoderLayer.forward()            ← models/deepseek_mtp.py:99
+                ① input_layernorm(hidden, residual)
+                ② self.self_attn(positions, hidden)          ← 上游 DeepseekV2MLAAttention
+                   → fused_qkv_a_proj (Q+KV 投影)
+                   → q_a_layernorm + q_b_proj (Q 上投影)
+                   → Indexer top-k (full 层计算, shared 层跳过) ← attention/indexer.py
+                   → mixed_quant_sparse_flash_mla_fp8        ← dsa_attn_kv_plan.py:261-273
+                     (sparse MLA attention, INT8 KV, DSA-CP)
+                   → o_proj (输出投影, SP 不 reduce)
+                ③ post_attention_layernorm(attn_out, residual)
+                ④ self.mlp(hidden, already_sp=True)          ← DeepseekV2MoE
+                   → gate (路由 256 选 8)
+                   → AscendMoERunner.forward()               ← ops/fused_moe/fused_moe.py:161
+                     → routed_experts (SP 分片 + FlashComm1) ← ops/fused_moe/routed_experts.py
+                     → shared_experts (multistream overlap)  ← ops/fused_moe/shared_experts.py
+                     → routed + shared 合并
+                     → all_reduce (SP 收尾)
+                ⑤ [如需] gather_sequence_parallel_output (all_gather)
+          → self.norm(hidden, residual)                      ← RMSNorm
+          → lm_head + logits_processor                        ← 上游 ParallelLMHead
+```
+
