+## 三、Decoder Layer 内部细粒度划分
+
+### 3.1 AscendDSACPDecoderLayer.forward 执行流程
+
+源码：`models/deepseek_mtp.py:99-134`
+
+```python
+def forward(self, positions, hidden_states, residual, llama_4_scaling=None):
+    if not self.input_is_sequence_parallel or ...:
+        # 非SP路径（前几层或特殊配置）
+        hidden_states, residual = super().forward(...)  # 上游 DeepseekV2DecoderLayer.forward
+    else:
+        # SP路径（大多数层）
+        # ① input_layernorm
+        hidden_states, residual = self.input_layernorm(hidden_states, residual)
+        # ② attention (SP 模式)
+        hidden_states = self.self_attn.mla_attn.forward_sequence_parallel(
+            positions, hidden_states, output_scale=output_scale)
+        # ③ post_attention_layernorm
+        hidden_states, residual = self.post_attention_layernorm(hidden_states, residual)
+        # ④ MoE (SP 分片)
+        hidden_states = self.mlp(hidden_states, already_sequence_parallel=True)
+    # ⑤ SP 收尾（如需）
+    if self.gather_sequence_parallel_output:
+        combined = tensor_model_parallel_all_gather(...)
+        ...
+    return hidden_states, residual
+```
+
+### 3.2 Attention 内部细粒度划分
+
+上游 `DeepseekV2MLAAttention`（`__init__` 被 `patch_deepseek_v2.py:67` 替换）内部流程：
+
+| 子步骤 | 操作 | 张量形状 (decode, N=1, TP=16) | 张量形状 (prefill, N=16384) |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| a. fused_qkv_a_proj | hidden→[cq, ckv] | [1, 2048] + [1, 576] | [N, 2048] + [N, 576] |
+| b. q_a_layernorm | RMSNorm(cq) | [1, 2048] | [N, 2048] |
+| c. q_b_proj | cq→Q[heads, qk_dim] | [4, 256, 192] | [N, 4, 256, 192] |
+| d. kv_a_layernorm | RMSNorm(ckv) | [1, 576] | [N, 576] |
+| e. KV cache 写入 | ckv→cache (INT8, kv_compress_epilog) | [1, 608B] | [N, 608B] |
+| f. Indexer top-k | (full 层) 选 top-2048 KV block | [1, 2048] int32 | [N, 2048] int32 |
+| g. SFA attention | Q × selected_KV → output | [1, 4, 256, 256] | [N, 4, 256, 256] |
+| h. o_proj | output→hidden | [1, 6144] (SP 不 reduce) | [N, 6144] (SP 不 reduce) |
+
+注：TP=16 → 64 heads / 16 = 4 local heads。DCP=16 → 每个 DCP rank 只持有 1/16 的 KV cache。
+
+### 3.3 MoE 内部细粒度划分
+
+`AscendMoERunner.forward`（`ops/fused_moe/fused_moe.py:161-245`）：
+
+| 子步骤 | 操作 | 张量形状 (decode, N=1, 8 experts) | 张量形状 (prefill, N=16384) |
+|---|---|---|---|
+| a. routed_input_transform | (如有) 投影 | [1, 6144] | [N, 6144] |
+| b. _maybe_pad_hidden_states | 对齐 hidden_dim | [1, 6144] | [N, 6144] |
+| c. _forward_entry | gate 路由 + expert 计算 | gate: [1, 256] → top-8 | gate: [N, 256] → top-8 |
+| d. routed_experts | 8 个 expert 的 gate_up + down | [8, 1, 2048] → [1, 6144] | [8, N/16, 2048] → [N/16, 6144] |
+| e. shared_experts | 1 个共享专家 (multistream overlap) | [1, 2048] → [1, 6144] | [N/16, 2048] → [N/16, 6144] |
+| f. routed + shared 合并 | add | [1, 6144] | [N/16, 6144] |
+| g. all_reduce | SP 收尾 (如需) | [1, 6144] | [N, 6144] |
+
