+| **Cache 物理视图** | `models/glm5next/cache_views.py` | `view_glm5_next_cache`（分发压缩indexer/tail/NoPE-MLA 视图） |
+| **MTP draft** | `models/glm5next/mtp.py` | `Glm5NextMTP`、`Glm5NextMultiTokenPredictorLayer`、index cache 跨步复用 |
+| **DSpark draft** | `models/glm5_dspark.py` | `Glm5DSparkForCausalLM`、`Glm5DSparkModel`（MLA backbone + Markov head） |
