+| **自定义算子** | `models/glm5next/ops/` | `causal_conv1d`、`kda(recurrent/chunk)`、`mhc_ops`、`state_ops` |
+| **Triton 算子** | `ops/triton/glm5_next_*.py` | CANN keypool 元数据、lightning indexer、tail compress |
