+| **Patch: Spec config** | `patch/platform/patch_speculative_config.py` | `glm5_next` → `glm5_next_mtp` 重映射；DSpark MLA 恢复 |
+| **Patch: KV cache** | `patch/platform/patch_kv_cache_utils.py` | 分发到 `get_glm5_next_kv_cache_groups` |
+| **Patch: DeepseekV2** | `patch/worker/patch_deepseek_v2.py` | Indexer 构造条件 + `skip_topk` 与 `is_mtp_layer` 联动 |
+| **Patch: Triton KDA** | `patch/worker/patch_triton.py` | 将 KDA 入口重绑定到 NPU 实现 |
+| **编译黑名单** | `compilation/compiler_interface.py:139,141` | 黑名单 `QuantBatchMatmulV3`(910C)、`QuantLightningIndexer`(950) |
+
