+## 五、模型注册到执行的完整调用链
+
+```
+用户启动: vllm serve GLM-5.2 --speculative-config '{"method":"mtp","num_speculative_tokens":3}'
+
+1. Config 加载
+   ├─ transformers 读 config.json → Glm5NextConfig (patch_glm5next_config.py 注册)
+   ├─ SpeculativeConfig.__post_init__ (patch_speculative_config.py)
+   │   ├─ hf_config_override: glm5_next → glm5_next_mtp + Glm5NextMTPModel
+   │   └─ _normalize_glm_mla_dspark (如果 DSpark)
+   └─ ModelConfig.is_deepseek_mla → True (patch_glm5next_config.py)
+
+2. 模型注册查找
+   └─ ModelRegistry → models/__init__.py:97 → "Glm5NextMTPModel" → Glm5NextMTP
+
+3. 模型加载
+   ├─ target: Glm5NextForCausalLM (或 ForConditionalGeneration)
+   │   └─ model.py: Glm5NextModel → make_layers(45, Glm5NextDecoderLayer)
+   │       └─ 每层: is_kda_layer(i) → KDA or MLA + Dense or MoE
+   └─ draft: Glm5NextMTP
+       └─ mtp.py: Glm5NextMultiTokenPredictor → ModuleDict(layers)
+
+4. KV Cache 分配
+   ├─ patch_kv_cache_utils.py → is_glm5_next_cache_spec → True
+   ├─ cache_config.py: get_glm5_next_kv_cache_groups
+   │   └─ 三组: 主MLA组 + 压缩indexer组 + tail组
+   └─ model_runner_v1.py: view_glm5_next_cache → 物理视图
+
+5. 推理执行 (每步)
+   ├─ Target forward: input_ids → embed → 45层(KDA/MLA+mHC+MoE) → norm → hidden
+   ├─ MTP propose: target_hidden → MTP层(eh_proj+decoder+shared_head) × K步 → draft_tokens
+   ├─ Target verify: [bonus, draft_0..K-1] → 1次causal forward → K+1 logits
+   └─ Rejection sampling: target_logits vs draft_logits → accepted + bonus
+
+6. ACLGraph 捕获 (可选)
+   ├─ compilation/compiler_interface.py: 黑名单检查
+   ├─ patch_eagle_speculator.py: SpeculatorCudaGraphManager → AutoRegressiveAclGraphManager
+   └─ acl_graph.py: FULL/PIECEWISE 图捕获
+```
+
