+## 四、mHC（多残差流超连接）
+
+源码：`vllm_ascend/models/glm5next/model.py:362-548`，`ops/mhc_ops.py`
+
+GLM-5.2 用 **mHC（multi-Head Hyper Connection）** 替代标准的残差连接，将每层扩展为 4 条并行残差流。
+
+### 4.1 mHC 结构
+
+```mermaid
+graph TB
+    subgraph "mHC (mhc_num_residual_streams=4)"
+        EXPAND["hc_expand<br/>[N, 4096] → [N, 4×4096]<br/>(replication)"]
+        
+        subgraph "Layer i"
+            HCPRE_ATTN["hc_pre (attn)<br/>npu_hc_pre_v2<br/>Sinkhorn 20 iters"]
+            ATTN["Self-Attention<br/>(KDA or MLA)"]
+            HCPOSTPRE_ATTN["hc_post_pre (ffn)<br/>post + pre fused"]
+            FFN["MLP / MoE"]
+        end
+        
+        subgraph "Layer i+1"
+            HCPRE_ATTN2["hc_pre (attn)"]
+            ATTN2["Self-Attention"]
+            HCPOSTPRE2["hc_post_pre (ffn)"]
+            FFN2["MLP / MoE"]
+        end
+        
+        EXPAND --> HCPRE_ATTN
+        HCPRE_ATTN -->|"layer_input"| ATTN
+        HCPRE_ATTN -->|"post_mix, res_mix"| HCPOSTPRE_ATTN
+        ATTN --> HCPOSTPRE_ATTN
+        HCPOSTPRE_ATTN -->|"layer_input"| FFN
+        HCPOSTPRE_ATTN -->|"post, comb, residual"| HCPRE_ATTN2
+        FFN --> HCPRE_ATTN2
+        
+        HCPOSTPRE2 --> CONTRACT
+        FFN2 --> HCPOSTPRE2
+    end
+    
+    CONTRACT["hc_contract<br/>[N, 4×4096] → [N, 4096]<br/>(averaging)"]
+```
+
+### 4.2 mHC 核心操作
+
+| 操作 | 代码位置 | 说明 |
+|---|---|---|
+| `hc_expand` | `mhc_ops.py:13-15` | `[N, H] → [N, n×H]`，复制扩展 |
+| `hc_contract` | `mhc_ops.py:18-19` | `[N, n×H] → [N, H]`，均值收缩 |
+| `hc_pre` | `model.py:490-514` | 调用 `npu_hc_pre_v2`：Sinkhorn 归一化（20 次迭代）+ post_mix / res_mix 计算 + RMSNorm |
+| `hc_post` | `model.py:516-525` | 调用 `npu_hc_post`：延迟的 post 混合 |
+| `hc_post_pre` | `model.py:527-548` | 融合 post + pre：先执行前一层的延迟 post，再执行当前层的 pre |
+
+**mHC 参数**（`config.py:72-79`）：
+
+| 参数 | 值 | 说明 |
+|---|---|---|
+| `mhc_num_residual_streams` (hc_mult) | 4 | 残差流数 |
+| `mhc_tau` | 0.05 | Sinkhorn 温度 |
+| `hc_eps` | 1e-6 | 数值稳定 epsilon |
+| `mhc_sinkhorn_iterations` | 20 | Sinkhorn 迭代次数 |
+| `mhc_post_mult_value` | 2.0 | post 混合缩放 |
+| `mhc_no_norm_weight` | False | 使用 norm 权重 |
+
+### 4.3 mHC forward 流程（`model.py:386-488`）
+
+```python
+# 非 mHC 路径（MTP 层或 70B 模型）
+if not self.mhc or self.is_mtp_layer:
+    residual = hidden_states
+    hidden_states = self.input_layernorm(hidden_states)
+    attn_output = self.self_attn(hidden_states, positions)
+    hidden_states, residual = self.post_attention_layernorm(attn_output, residual)
+    hidden_states = self.mlp(hidden_states)
+    return hidden_states, residual, None, None
+
+# mHC 路径（标准 decoder layer）
+x = hidden_states
+if post is None:  # Layer 0
+    x = hc_expand(x, self.n)        # [N, H] → [N, 4H]
+    residual = x
+    post, comb, x = self.hc_pre(x, ...)  # Sinkhorn + norm
+else:  # Layer 1+
+    residual, post, comb, x = self.hc_post_pre(x, residual, post, comb, ...)
+
+x = self.self_attn(x, positions)   # attention on expanded state
+residual, post, comb, x = self.hc_post_pre(x, ...)  # post-attn + pre-ffn
+x = self.mlp(x)                    # FFN on expanded state
+
+if last_layer:
+    x = self.hc_post(x, ...)       # finalize deferred post
+    x = hc_contract(x, self.n)     # [N, 4H] → [N, H]
+    return x, None, None, None
+
+return x, residual, post, comb     # defer post to next layer
+```
+
+**关键设计**：每层的 `hc_post` 被延迟到下一层的 `hc_pre` 中执行（`hc_post_pre`），避免额外的 kernel launch。只有最后一层才真正执行 `hc_post` + `hc_contract`。
+
+### 4.4 mHC 参数结构
+
+每个 mHC 层有 4 组参数（`model.py:376-384`）：
+
+```
+hc_attn_fn:    [mix_hc, d_model] = [(2+4)*4, 4*4096] = [24, 16384]  # attention 混合
+hc_attn_base:  [24]
+hc_attn_scale: [3]
+
+hc_ffn_fn:     [24, 16384]   # FFN 混合
+hc_ffn_base:   [24]
+hc_ffn_scale:  [3]
+```
+
+其中 `mix_hc = (2 + n) * n = (2+4)*4 = 24`，`d_model = n * hidden_size = 4 * 4096 = 16384`。
