+## 五、投机解码（MTP）结构
+
+源码：`vllm_ascend/models/glm5next/mtp.py:39-410`
+
+### 5.1 MTP 层结构
+
+```mermaid
+graph TB
+    subgraph "Glm5NextMTP (top-level)"
+        subgraph "Glm5NextMultiTokenPredictor"
+            EMB_MTP["embed_tokens<br/>(shared with target)"]
+            
+            subgraph "MTP Layer 0 (num_mtp_layers=1)"
+                FEN["fused_eh_norm<br/>positions zero + enorm + hnorm + cat"]
+                EH["eh_proj<br/>2×4096 → 4096"]
+                BLOCK["mtp_block<br/>Glm5NextDecoderLayer<br/>(MLA + MoE, is_mtp_layer=True)"]
+                SH["shared_head<br/>norm + LMHead<br/>(shared with target)"]
+            end
+        end
+        
+        LOGITS["logits_processor"]
+    end
+    
+    IDS["input_ids"] --> EMB_MTP
+    EMB_MTP -->|"inputs_embeds"| FEN
+    THS["target_hidden_states"] -->|"previous_hidden"| FEN
+    FEN --> EH
+    EH --> BLOCK
+    BLOCK --> SH
+    SH --> LOGITS
+    LOGITS -->|"argmax"| DRAFT["draft_token"]
+```
+
+### 5.2 MTP forward 流程（`mtp.py:80-104`）
+
+```python
+def forward(self, input_ids, positions, previous_hidden_states, inputs_embeds, spec_step_idx):
+    # 融合：位置0清零 + enorm(embed) + hnorm(prev) + cat → [N, 2H]
+    eh_input = fused_eh_norm(
+        positions, inputs_embeds, previous_hidden_states,
+        self.enorm.weight, self.hnorm.weight, self.enorm.variance_epsilon)
+    
+    # 投影 [2H] → [H]
+    hidden_states = self.eh_proj(eh_input)
+    
+    # Decoder block: MLA attention + MoE MLP
+    hidden_states, residual, _, _ = self.mtp_block(
+        positions=positions, hidden_states=hidden_states, residual=None)
+    
+    # Fused residual add + RMSNorm
+    hidden_states, _ = self.shared_head.norm(hidden_states, residual=residual)
+    return hidden_states, hidden_states  # (output, recycled for next step)
+```
+
+### 5.3 MTP 层选择机制（`mtp.py:153-170`）
+
+```python
+class Glm5NextMultiTokenPredictor(nn.Module):
+    def forward(self, input_ids, positions, previous_hidden_states, inputs_embeds, spec_step_idx):
+        current_step_idx = spec_step_idx % self.num_mtp_layers  # ★ 取模选层
+        return self._mtp_layers[current_step_idx](
+            input_ids, positions, previous_hidden_states, inputs_embeds, current_step_idx)
+```
+
+当 `num_nextn_predict_layers=1` 时（默认），所有 draft step 复用同一个 MTP 层。
+
+### 5.4 Index Cache 跨步复用优化（`mtp.py:137-148`）
+
+```python
+def set_skip_topk(self, skip: bool):
+    # index_share_for_mtp_iteration: step 0 computes top-k, steps 1+ reuse.
+    for mla_attn in self._mtp_mla_attns:
+        mla_attn.skip_topk = skip
+
+def compact_topk_indices(self, slot_ids: torch.Tensor):
+    """Gather the top-k index rows at slot_ids to the front of the buffer."""
+    num_slots = slot_ids.numel()
+    for mla_attn in self._mtp_mla_attns:
+        topk_indices_buffer = mla_attn.topk_indices_buffer
+        topk_indices_buffer[:num_slots] = topk_indices_buffer[slot_ids]
+```
+
+- **Step 0**：MTP 层的 MLA attention 计算 sparse top-k index
+- **Step 1+**：跳过 top-k 计算（`skip_topk=True`），直接复用 step 0 的 index
+- 配置项：`index_share_for_mtp_iteration = true`
+
+### 5.5 MTP 与 target 的对接
+
+```mermaid
+sequenceDiagram
+    participant T as Target Model (45 layers)
+    participant R as Model Runner
+    participant M as MTP Drafter
+    
+    T->>T: forward(input_ids, positions)
+    T->>T: 45 层 decoder (KDA + MLA + MoE + mHC)
+    T->>T: norm → hidden_states [N, 4096]
+    T->>R: return hidden_states
+    
+    R->>R: sampler(target_hidden) → bonus_token
+    R->>R: get_mtp_target_hidden_states()
+    R->>M: _propose(target_token_ids, target_positions, target_hidden_states, K=3)
+    
+    M->>M: Step 0 (spec_step_idx=0): embed + hnorm(target_hidden) → mtp_block → shared_head → draft_token[0]
+    M->>M: Step 1 (spec_step_idx=1): embed(draft[0]) + hnorm(hidden⁰) → mtp_block → shared_head → draft_token[1]
+    M->>M: Step 2 (spec_step_idx=2): embed(draft[1]) + hnorm(hidden¹) → mtp_block → shared_head → draft_token[2]
+    M->>R: return [draft_0, draft_1, draft_2]
+    
+    R->>T: verify([bonus, draft_0, draft_1, draft_2])
+    T->>T: 一次前向验证 4 个 token
+    T->>R: rejection sampling → accepted tokens
+```
